   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Authority Ministry Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JFA IV supports the Education Sector Strategic Plan 2025&#x2013;2027, which aims to improve access, equity, quality, and governance in Palestine&#x2019;s education system. Coordinated through the Ministry of Education and funded by Belgium, Finland, Germany (KfW), and Ireland, the programme includes school construction, curriculum reform, capacity building, and inclusive education initiatives. Four strategic objectives are described: Strategic Objective 1: Strengthening the basic requirements to ensure equitable and safe access to the national education system, and retain it. Strategic Objective 2: Enhancing inclusive quality education through developing the basic elements of the education process. Strategic Objective 3: Strengthening the governance and management of the national education system. Strategic Objective 4: Educational recovery and reconstruction</narrative>
  </description>
